from pathlib import Path
import json,html
R=Path(__file__).resolve().parent;s=json.loads((R/'SUMMARY.json').read_text())
rows=''.join('<tr>'+''.join('<td>'+html.escape(str(v))+'</td>' for v in [r['layout'],r['scenario'],r['flags'],r['not_estimable'],round(r['medianV'],2),r['pass_gate']])+'</tr>' for r in s['results'])
doc='''<!doctype html><meta charset="utf-8"><title>All interior positions qualification</title><style>body{font:17px/1.55 system-ui;max-width:1050px;margin:40px auto;padding:20px;background:#f8faf7;color:#173c30}td,th{padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #c4d4c9;text-align:left}table{border-collapse:collapse}</style><h1>All interior positions: qualification fails</h1>
<p>Frozen before1,000 fresh synthetic trials. Every interior source position is a candidate, with exact maximum-weight disjoint pairing based on bodies and readable eligibility. All positions are considered; not all can be selected simultaneously. Line composition, exact positions, exact word bodies, pages and line lengths remain controlled. No Voynich files were opened or scored. H/F remain separate.</p>
<table><tr><th>Layout</th><th>Scenario</th><th>Flags/100</th><th>Not estimable/100</th><th>Median V</th><th>Gate</th></tr>'''+rows+'''</table>
<p>All positive power gates fail. No dataset meets the earlier V≥80 support rule. Sparse nulls are all not estimable: their zero flags satisfy the numerical false-flag gate but provide no evidence of useful conditional calibration. The correct conclusion is insufficient usable comparisons, not evidence against association.</p>
<h2>More realistic structure, limited realism</h2><p>The sparse generator uses variable line lengths6–14,12bodies,35% origin prevalence and2% unknown slots. The dense diagnostic uses length12,fourbodies,70% origin prevalence and no missing slots. Both create actual token sequences: sh/ch origins, other words and possible qok followers. They are authored stress cases, not fitted historical distributions.</p>
<p>Unlike earlier independent event arrays, a following origin cannot also be qok. Planted+.15/+.45 effects operate when a following nonorigin token is available; the marginal event-level effect is therefore diluted. In particular,70% origin density makes the dense diagnostic rich in origin comparisons but poor in available qok followers. Its low power must not be compared directly to the earlier clean +15-point event controls. This limitation is retained, not silently corrected after outcomes.</p>
<p>Unknown slots retain position and block adjacency. First and final origins are excluded, line boundaries never crossed, and no eligible-word repacking occurs. Exact matching was checked against20 independent exhaustive small-graph oracles; subset distributions against enumeration; token boundary/unknown fixtures passed. These checks do not constitute full corpus-parser validation.</p>
<p>The bottleneck is broader than the eight fixed positions. Exact-body recurrence within the same page, source-line length and paired positions remains rare. This does not prove that the complete set of margin-preserving arrangements is empty; the method still selects disjoint position pairs. Changing matching assumptions or using a more complete conditional null would be a new candidate requiring fresh qualification.</p>
<p>All historical failures remain intact. No threshold was relaxed, no failed trial removed, and no manuscript rescore performed.</p>
<p><a href="PROTOCOL.json">Frozen rules</a> · <a href="FREEZE.json">Hashes</a> · <a href="SUMMARY.json">Results and intervals</a> · <a href="TRIALS.json">Every trial</a> · <a href="VERIFICATION.json">Verification</a></p>'''
(R/'report.html').write_text(doc,encoding='utf-8')
assert all((R/f).exists() for f in ['PROTOCOL.json','FREEZE.json','SUMMARY.json','TRIALS.json','VERIFICATION.json'])
print('Report saved; links checked; rendering not inspected.')
